(** GENERATED by C/gen-elements-current-ptr-jets.py; do not edit.

    Elements "current input" jets of the shape
      [if (numInputs <= ix) return false; HELPER(dst, &input[ix].FIELD); return true]
    against [primitive CurrentIndex >>> assert (primitive P)]
    (Simplicity.Elements.Programs.Transaction).  The environment bound
    [envIx < length inputs] makes the C bounds test succeed, so the jets are
    total.  Element relations and cells are those of the indexed jets. *)
